<div style="font-family:arial; font-size:12px;">
    {% set htmlFileType = constant('Shopware\\Core\\Checkout\\Document\\Service\\HtmlRenderer::FILE_EXTENSION') %}
    {% set Ayy1Link = rawUrl('frontend.account.order.single.document.a11y', { documentId: document.id, 'deepLinkCode': document.deepLinkCode, fileType: htmlFileType }, salesChannel.domains|first.url)%}

    {% if order.orderCustomer.salutation %}{{ order.orderCustomer.salutation.translated.letterName ~ ' ' }}{% endif %}{{ order.orderCustomer.firstName }} {{ order.orderCustomer.lastName }},<br>

    <p>
        A new document has been added to your order {{ order.orderNumber }}.You should have received the original document in a separate mail.<br>

        For better accessibility we also provide an HTML version of this document here: <a href="{{ Ayy1Link }}" target="_blank">
            {{ document.config.filenamePrefix }}{{ document.config.documentNumber }}{{ document.config.filenameSuffix }}_{{ document.createdAt|format_date(pattern='Y-MM-dd') }}.{{ htmlFileType }}
        </a>.<br><br>

        For data protection reasons the HTML version requires a login.<br>

        In case of a guest order, you can use your mail address and postal code of the billing address.
    </p>
    <br>
</div>
